## =============================================================================
##
##  Everything specific to this estimator concerns the first step, the
##  conditional CDF of P given W.  The structural model is untouched by all
##  four arguments below: every exogenous regressor stays a regressor.

## The default conditions on all exogenous variables of the model, minus the
## polynomial and interaction terms that Section 3.1.4 says to leave out -- the
## kernel estimator accommodates nonlinearity by itself.  A message names what
## was dropped.
np1 <- CopReg2sCOPEnp(formula       = lsales ~ lprice |
                                      Income + I(Income^2) + Advertising + Age,
                      data          = dat3,
