                      verbose       = interactive())

## heterogeneous = is Proposition 3: the endogeneity itself may differ across
## groups.  The conditional CDF is estimated within each subsample and the
## copula terms are parameterised against the first group, so lprice_cop is the
## reference group and lprice_cop.<level> are deviations from it -- the
